WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.721 --> 00:00:04.757
- What's up Believe Nation?

00:00:04.757 --> 00:00:07.288
I want to give you some free stuff,

00:00:07.288 --> 00:00:09.918
and I need your advice on how to do it.

00:00:09.918 --> 00:00:11.182
Let me give you the back story.

00:00:11.182 --> 00:00:13.405
This is all because of
the YouTube algorithm.

00:00:13.405 --> 00:00:16.636
One of the things that they
are heavily prioritizing

00:00:16.636 --> 00:00:19.522
is what's being called view velocity.

00:00:19.522 --> 00:00:24.387
So the more a video gets
views in the first 48 hours,

00:00:24.387 --> 00:00:28.275
or really the first day, that
really helps YouTube decide,

00:00:28.275 --> 00:00:30.527
should we promote this video more or not?

00:00:30.527 --> 00:00:33.135
And so what really helps is
getting subscribers involved

00:00:33.135 --> 00:00:36.207
to watch the videos, and leave comments,

00:00:36.207 --> 00:00:37.746
and engage with it and share it.

00:00:37.746 --> 00:00:40.143
And so I want to try to figure
out a way to make YouTube

00:00:40.143 --> 00:00:44.398
happy, to make me happy,
and to make you guys happy,

00:00:44.398 --> 00:00:45.927
all at the same time.

00:00:45.927 --> 00:00:47.106
What I'm thinking of doing ...

00:00:47.106 --> 00:00:48.513
And hear me out, and I want your advice.

00:00:48.513 --> 00:00:51.601
It's not concrete, so
I need your feedback.

00:00:51.601 --> 00:00:53.493
What I'm thinking of doing is,

00:00:53.493 --> 00:00:55.723
having some kind of daily contest.

00:00:55.723 --> 00:00:58.262
So what I want to do is
at midnight Eastern ...

00:00:58.262 --> 00:01:00.408
I have three videos
that I put up every day.

00:01:00.408 --> 00:01:03.135
What I want to do is, look
at each one of those videos,

00:01:03.135 --> 00:01:07.213
and look at which comment
that's been left on the videos

00:01:07.213 --> 00:01:09.357
has the most thumbs up.

00:01:09.357 --> 00:01:13.936
And then I also want to give
a prize away for whoever

00:01:13.936 --> 00:01:16.936
has the most believe worthy comment.

00:01:18.238 --> 00:01:20.067
What I want to avoid us
just people commenting

00:01:20.067 --> 00:01:21.533
for the sake of commenting.

00:01:21.533 --> 00:01:24.350
I mean, that'll help, that'll
help with the algorithm.

00:01:24.350 --> 00:01:26.029
If you come and watch, leave a comment.

00:01:26.029 --> 00:01:27.510
But it's just blah, blah, blah.

00:01:27.510 --> 00:01:30.959
That'll help, but I don't
want to just fill the videos

00:01:30.959 --> 00:01:33.535
with comment spam, I want good comments.

00:01:33.535 --> 00:01:35.967
I want believe worthy comments.

00:01:35.967 --> 00:01:37.919
And so it's trying to
encourage people to leave solid

00:01:37.919 --> 00:01:40.083
comments that get uploaded.

00:01:40.083 --> 00:01:43.624
And whoever has the comment
with the most thumbs up

00:01:43.624 --> 00:01:45.339
at the end of the day for that day,

00:01:45.339 --> 00:01:48.328
across those three videos,
gets some kind of prize.

00:01:48.328 --> 00:01:50.508
And whoever has the most
believe worthy, you know?

00:01:50.508 --> 00:01:54.701
Just a positive, uplifting,
believe kind of comment,

00:01:54.701 --> 00:01:56.042
they get a prize too.

00:01:56.042 --> 00:01:58.739
So a daily prize for two people.

00:01:58.739 --> 00:02:01.779
The videos that we've launched that day.

00:02:01.779 --> 00:02:03.778
I want to know, what do you guys think?

00:02:03.778 --> 00:02:05.451
And I want to know what kind of prizes

00:02:05.451 --> 00:02:06.889
you would like to see.

00:02:06.889 --> 00:02:09.389
Let's keep it realistic, okay?

00:02:10.247 --> 00:02:12.881
Let's keep our prize
expectations realistic.

00:02:12.881 --> 00:02:14.726
But I love to know your thoughts.

00:02:14.726 --> 00:02:17.609
I mean the overall goal is,
we need to get as many people

00:02:17.609 --> 00:02:21.505
as possible to the videos
within in the first 24 hours

00:02:21.505 --> 00:02:22.811
of it going up.

00:02:22.811 --> 00:02:27.608
And, I want to make it in a
way that isn't super cheesy,

00:02:27.608 --> 00:02:30.222
and provides value to everybody involved.

00:02:30.222 --> 00:02:32.438
And so that was the best
way that I thought of,

00:02:32.438 --> 00:02:34.242
and I'd love to get your feedback.

00:02:34.242 --> 00:02:36.590
So again, across the three
videos that we put up

00:02:36.590 --> 00:02:38.690
at that day, at midnight,
I look at which video,

00:02:38.690 --> 00:02:40.046
look at all the comments,
so it's encouraging

00:02:40.046 --> 00:02:41.113
you to leave comment.

00:02:41.113 --> 00:02:43.052
Watch a video, leave a comment,

00:02:43.052 --> 00:02:45.155
a thoughtful one, an interesting one.

00:02:45.155 --> 00:02:48.269
Whichever video, whichever
comment has the most

00:02:48.269 --> 00:02:51.242
thumbs ups for the day gets a prize,

00:02:51.242 --> 00:02:53.321
and whoever has the most
believe worthy comment,

00:02:53.321 --> 00:02:56.473
as judged by my team,
will also get a prize.

00:02:56.473 --> 00:02:59.558
Two prizes, every single day.

00:02:59.558 --> 00:03:01.045
Let me know what you think.

00:03:01.045 --> 00:03:02.965
Let me know if you have other
strategies for view velocity.

00:03:02.965 --> 00:03:04.488
I'm always curious about that.

00:03:04.488 --> 00:03:06.364
And let me know what
those prizes should be,

00:03:06.364 --> 00:03:08.518
and what you think of
the overall strategy.

00:03:08.518 --> 00:03:11.587
I want to make something,
again, that fits well for you,

00:03:11.587 --> 00:03:14.491
and you're happy with, and is a fun ...

00:03:14.491 --> 00:03:16.986
Is a fun challenge, and a fun daily game.

00:03:16.986 --> 00:03:18.695
And I can give back, and
provide more value to you,

00:03:18.695 --> 00:03:19.757
as well to the prizes.

00:03:19.757 --> 00:03:20.738
So let me know!

00:03:20.738 --> 00:03:22.175
I want to give you free stuff.

00:03:22.175 --> 00:03:23.727
Leave it down the comments below,

00:03:23.727 --> 00:03:25.658
and super excited to hear
what you have to say.

00:03:25.658 --> 00:03:27.209
Thank you guys so much for watching.

00:03:27.209 --> 00:03:29.458
As always, your loyalty, I love it.

00:03:29.458 --> 00:03:30.455
It means the world to me.

00:03:30.455 --> 00:03:31.983
I hope you have a great weekend.

00:03:31.983 --> 00:03:33.126
I believe in you!

00:03:33.126 --> 00:03:34.953
I hope you continue to
believe in yourself,

00:03:34.953 --> 00:03:36.977
and do whatever your one word is.

00:03:36.977 --> 00:03:39.060
Much love, see you soon.

